menu "Robot Telemetry"

config ROBOT_TELEMETRY
    bool "Enable RF telemetry via nRF24 ACK payload"
    default n
    help
      When enabled, temperature and weapon RPM are packed into a 16-byte
      ACK payload and sent back to the radio dongle on every received
      control packet. Also enables EN_DPL and EN_ACK_PAY in the nRF24
      FEATURE register and DPL on pipe 0.
      Pair with CONFIG_DONGLE_TELEMETRY on the radio dongle.
      Disable for competition builds — zero overhead when off.

endmenu
